# Fixture images and the language model are GENERATED, not authored, and
# they are large (class-b alone is ~19 MB of incompressible noise). The
# generator is deterministic -- same seed, same pixels -- so regenerating is
# equivalent to checking them in, without the repo carrying them forever.
#
# Ground truth JSON and reports/ ARE committed: they are small, they are the
# contract the harness scores against, and they let the schema test run
# without generating anything.
class-a-clean/*.png
class-b-skewed/*.png
class-c-photos/*.jpg
assets/
